    {
      "name": "🔗 Backend Integration",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Backend Health Check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BACKEND_URL}}/api/health",
              "host": ["{{BACKEND_URL}}"],
              "path": ["api", "health"]
            },
            "description": "Check if backend is running"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Send Arduino Data to Backend",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"sessionId\": \"S001\",\n  \"timestamp\": 25041,\n  \"heartRate\": 72,\n  \"hrvRmssd\": 45.5,\n  \"spo2\": 97,\n  \"motionLevel\": 10.23,\n  \"restlessnessIndex\": 0.009\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BACKEND_URL}}/api/sensor-data/arduino/data",
              "host": ["{{BACKEND_URL}}"],
              "path": ["api", "sensor-data", "arduino", "data"]
            },
            "description": "Send Arduino sensor data directly to backend\n\nThis endpoint accepts the exact format that Arduino sends"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "📋 Testing Guide",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "README - How to Use",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://localhost:8000/docs",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "path": ["docs"]
            },
            "description": "# ML Model Testing Guide\n\n## Setup\n1. Ensure ML Model is running on port 8000\n   ```\n   python -m uvicorn main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000\n   ```\n\n2. Ensure Backend is running on port 5000\n   ```\n   npm run dev\n   ```\n\n## Test Sequence\n\n### Step 1: Health Checks\n- [ ] ML Health Check\n- [ ] Backend Health Check\n\n### Step 2: Predictions\n- [ ] TEST 1: Normal Engaged Student\n- [ ] TEST 2: Stressed Student\n- [ ] TEST 3: Disengaged Student\n- [ ] TEST 4: Hyperactive Student\n- [ ] TEST 5-7: Edge Cases\n\n### Step 3: Model Training\n- [ ] Train All Models\n\n### Step 4: Integration\n- [ ] Send Arduino Data to Backend\n\n## Expected Responses\n\n**Prediction Response:**\n```json\n{\n  \"engagement\": {\n    \"level\": \"high\",\n    \"confidence\": 0.87\n  },\n  \"stress\": {\n    \"level\": \"normal\",\n    \"confidence\": 1.0\n  },\n  \"hobby\": {\n    \"activity\": \"gaming\",\n    \"confidence\": 0.92\n  },\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-02-18T20:59:30.123Z\"\n}\n```\n\n## Sensor Data Ranges\n\n| Sensor | Normal Range | Stressed | Disengaged |\n|--------|--------------|----------|------------|\n| Heart Rate | 60-80 bpm | >100 bpm | <60 bpm |\n| HRV RMSSD | 40-50 ms | <30 ms | >60 ms |\n| Blood Oxygen | 95-99% | <94% | >98% |\n| Motion Level | 5-20 | >30 | 0-2 |\n| Restlessness | 0.05-0.15 | >0.4 | <0.05 |\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### ML Model returns 500 error\n- Models not trained: Run `python train_models.py`\n- Restart ML server: Kill and restart uvicorn\n\n### Cannot connect to ML URL\n- Ensure port 8000 is not blocked\n- Check firewall settings\n- Verify uvicorn is running\n\n### Backend returns 404\n- Ensure backend is running on port 5000\n- Check API endpoint paths\n"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
